 {"id": "PEDS-C37-058", "sec": "HUS", "page": 167, "q": "In diarrhea-positive HUS, Shiga toxin produces —", "opts": ["Direct bladder obstruction", "Primary hepatocyte injury", "Endothelial damage", "Ciliary dyskinesia"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Endothelial damage. (Book p167)", "type": "mcq"},
